  planner_response {
    response: "I have updated and expanded the application to deliver a dedicated, interactive bug bounty and pentesting suite:\n\n- **Interactive Attack Graph with Free Node Dragging & Zoom**:\n  - **Free Node Movement**: You can now click and drag any node (subdomain, IP, port, vulnerability) anywhere on the canvas with smooth real-time connection re-routing.\n  - **Pan & Zoom Controls**: Support for mouse-wheel zooming centered on your cursor, canvas drag-to-pan, 1-click centering, fullscreen mode, and SVG export.\n  - **Layout Presets**: Switch between *Orbital*, *Hierarchical Tree*, and *Organic Grid* layout distributions with instant reset capabilities.\n\n- **Linux Terminal & Hacker Arsenal Shell (`@w0rmingstar`)**:\n  - **Root RedTeam Shell**: An interactive terminal emulator branded for `@w0rmingstar` on HackerOne with ANSI styling, command history (`Up`/`Down`), and `Tab` autocomplete.\n  - **Live Executable Pentest Suite**: Run commands that trigger real backend APIs and update your attack surface in real time (`subfinder`, `crtsh`, `dnsx`, `dig`, `httpx`, `curl`, `wayback`, `katana`, `nuclei`, `takeovers`, `assets`, `vulns`, `gemini`, `h1-report`).\n  - **Quick Arsenal Dock**: One-click quick action buttons to launch automated 1-click scans or inject complex commands.\n  - **HackerOne Header Integration**: Default headers set to `X-HackerOne-Research: w0rmingstar` across all CLI generation, playbooks, HTTP probes, and reports.\n\n- **Branding & Visual Refinement**:\n  - Header updated to feature **w0rmingstar** and the **HackerOne Pentest Suite** badge."
    modified_response: "I have updated and expanded the application to deliver a dedicated, interactive bug bounty and pentesting suite:\n\n- **Interactive Attack Graph with Free Node Dragging & Zoom**:\n  - **Free Node Movement**: You can now click and drag any node (subdomain, IP, port, vulnerability) anywhere on the canvas with smooth real-time connection re-routing.\n  - **Pan & Zoom Controls**: Support for mouse-wheel zooming centered on your cursor, canvas drag-to-pan, 1-click centering, fullscreen mode, and SVG export.\n  - **Layout Presets**: Switch between *Orbital*, *Hierarchical Tree*, and *Organic Grid* layout distributions with instant reset capabilities.\n\n- **Linux Terminal & Hacker Arsenal Shell (`@w0rmingstar`)**:\n  - **Root RedTeam Shell**: An interactive terminal emulator branded for `@w0rmingstar` on HackerOne with ANSI styling, command history (`Up`/`Down`), and `Tab` autocomplete.\n  - **Live Executable Pentest Suite**: Run commands that trigger real backend APIs and update your attack surface in real time (`subfinder`, `crtsh`, `dnsx`, `dig`, `httpx`, `curl`, `wayback`, `katana`, `nuclei`, `takeovers`, `assets`, `vulns`, `gemini`, `h1-report`).\n  - **Quick Arsenal Dock**: One-click quick action buttons to launch automated 1-click scans or inject complex commands.\n  - **HackerOne Header Integration**: Default headers set to `X-HackerOne-Research: w0rmingstar` across all CLI generation, playbooks, HTTP probes, and reports.\n\n- **Branding & Visual Refinement**:\n  - Header updated to feature **w0rmingstar** and the **HackerOne Pentest Suite** badge."
